OL,3,ATeen who discovered her painting talent
OL,4,Ain garden shed competes for TV art
OL,5,Aprize
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 19-year-old painter from Swansea who
OL,8,Fhas sold artwork for tens of thousands
OL,9,Fof pounds is due to appear on the TV
OL,10,Fart competition, Portrait Artist of the
OL,11,FYear.
OL,13,FMakenzy Beard discovered her talent for
OL,14,Fpainting during the Covid lockdown
OL,15,Fafter she decided to try out her
OL,16,Fmother's old paint brushes in the
OL,17,Fgarden shed.
OL,19,FShe said she felt "up for the
OL,20,Fchallenge" of painting celebrity
OL,21,Fsitters in front of TV cameras and a
OL,22,Fhighly respected panel of judges.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
