OL,3,ATeen who discovered her painting talent
OL,4,Ain garden shed competes for TV art
OL,5,Aprize
OL,6,
OL,7,FBeard is currently putting together her
OL,8,Fsecond collection of work, which will
OL,9,Finclude about 20 paintings that reflect
OL,10,Fher "view of the world" and interest in
OL,11,Fphilosophy.
